      "claim": "Since $1-x=(1-c)(1-(x-c)/(1-c))$ and $1-c>0$, apply [L1] with $t=(x-c)/(1-c)$. This gives the second formula precisely when $|x-c|<1-c$.",
      "step": "2.1",
      "inputs": [
        "L1"
      ]
    }
  ],
