      "quote": "A bounded $f:Q\\to\\mathbb R$ on a nondegenerate rectangle is Riemann\nintegrable if and only if, for every $\\varepsilon>0$, some grid $P$ satisfies\n$U(f,P)-L(f,P)<\\varepsilon$.",
